Package: intent-os
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Intent OS contributors <intent-os@local.invalid>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-fastapi, python3-uvicorn, python3-watchdog, xdotool, x11-utils
Description: Local Ubuntu activity capture for Intent OS
 Captures consented desktop, Firefox, VS Code, and shell metadata locally for
 Intent OS. It stores events on the current machine and exposes a loopback API.
